## INDEPENDENCE DECLARATION
I audited this packet read-only, from the packet text alone: no tools, no file reads, no network, no edits, no re-runs. I had no role in preregistration, generation, execution, or dispatch of PR-EXP-04. All conclusions below are drawn from the quoted fields; anything not evidenced by the packet is labelled UNVERIFIED. The two engineering dispatch incidents (a1 INPUT_MISSING x4, a2 HASH_MISMATCH x4) are treated as disclosed non-scientific infrastructure events and are not scored against the science; their claimed zero side effects are UNVERIFIED from this packet.

